ously stupid logout - 4 clicks before you can ensure your money might be safe.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-05T05:30:38-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.236.0"}, "id": {"label": "14630427127"}, "title": {"label": "Cannot use on apple device under ios 16 and under"}, "content": {"label": "Terrible update!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-04T13:01:58-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14628055859"}, "title": {"label": "Missing feature"}, "content": {"label": "Can\u2019t see our household details in the app but I can on the website.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-04T09:06:00-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14627293129"}, "title": {"label": "Downgrade"}, "content": {"label": "The new visa chequing card doesn\u2019t work with certain websites compared to the previous mastercard.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-03T11:10:57-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14623763212"}, "title": {"label": "10$ / month for USD"}, "content": {"label": "It is a good investing app but still far away from being a trading app. It is a well behind other brokers. This is my first point. The second point is : Why should I pay 10$ / month for keeping US accounts, not one broker I use has such fees, that\u2019s nonsense.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-02T23:52:31-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14621722041"}, "title": {"label": "Did you test the update completely before posting it?"}, "content": {"label": "You updated the app two days ago and it cannot be used on my iPad since. The text size is so big that the keypad covers the most of the screen.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-02T19:45:31-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14621148018"}, "title": {"label": "Simple and Intuitive Investing"}, "content": {"label": "I\u2019ve been using Wealthsimple for a while now, and it\u2019s completely changed how I manage my money. The app is incredibly intuitive and makes investing feel accessible, even if you\u2019re just starting out. I love the clean design and how easy it is to track my portfolio. It\u2019s also great to have everything from managed investing to self-directed trading all in one place. Highly recommend it for anyone looking for a simple, modern way to invest.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-02T06:48:42-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14618937853"}, "title": {"label": "The best!"}, "content": {"label": "Simply the elite app!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-02T06:18:47-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14618835574"}, "title": {"label": "iPad update sucks"}, "content": {"label": "See above. I should be able to resize the window for more content, but the window also resizes the content in some weird landscape mode\u2026why? It was perfectly usable before, now I can\u2019t see everything.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-02T05:02:03-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14618585983"}, "title": {"label": "How to Push Users Away\u2026"}, "content": {"label": "At its core, the premise of Wealthsimple is exceptional! \n\nHowever\u2026\n\nThey still routinely cause reliability and UI/UX issues in the app and their back-end with nonstop, evidently rushed, changes. \n\nAnd now harassing users with single-point-of-failure passkey / \u201ctrusted device\u201d nag screens, including 2FA prompts when trading. But accepting deposits is just fine, of course. \n\nThis isn\u2019t really about account security. It\u2019s about reducing their own support overhead by pushing it onto their users. Passkeys are a great theory\u2026until you change or lose hardware, or it breaks. Trusted devices are even worse.\n\nYou also don\u2019t need to spam me with random 2FA prompts for making a routine buy, in the same location and on the same device I routinely use. Kindly stop faking security for your own metrics. \n\nPSA: Wealthsimple and CIRO have both had breaches which resulted in thousands of SIN numbers  exposed in the last two years.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-01T14:32:21-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14616455740"}, "title": {"label": "Top Notch user experience!"}, "content": {"label": "Amazing banking and investing app, I\u2019ve been using it for years! Use code A3TK5W for a $30 reward!!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-01T13:23:50-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.236.0"}, "id": {"label": "14616276817"}, "title": {"label": "Can\u2019t use on mobile"}, "content": {"label": "My 1st gen iphone SE can\u2019t update the app, because it requires an iOS update unavailable for my phone. Cant see why I would need a newer model just to use an app like wealthsimple. Probably not the fault of the app\u2019s developers, but annoying to trade a few backend patches for the complete inability to use the app.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-10-01T07:54:31-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14615247854"}, "title": {"label": "Location tracking"}, "content": {"label": "Worst trading app in Canada. If the monthly lottery isn\u2019t annoying enough. Making a profit off a trade is just about impossible, the app is filled with hidden fees. They do the cheap to buy expensive to sell model. Pay a premium during tax season that allows you to manually varify every trade you made over the previous year, (which could be thousands) what a service\n\nCompany tracks your location without your permission", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-30T15:34:12-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14612639656"}, "title": {"label": "Incredible App & Company"}, "content": {"label": "Wealthsimple is the most intuitive and wonderful app I\u2019ve ever used. Their app and website are beautiful, their banking and investing services are amazing, and their support team is responsive. Thank you \ud83d\ude4f", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-30T14:14:58-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.1"}, "id": {"label": "14612437705"}, "title": {"label": "Amazing Experience"}, "content": {"label": "It has been an absolute hassle free experience working with Wealthsimple. \nFrom account opening to transfers. Everything has been fast, simple and easy.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-30T07:17:36-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.236.0"}, "id": {"label": "14611143358"}, "title": {"label": "Won\u2019t work"}, "content": {"label": "Installed ver 2.245\nStarted app and it says a newer version is waiting. Follow link and there is no updated app to install. Stuck! Please fix. I cannot use app.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-29T16:03:31-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.0"}, "id": {"label": "14608861403"}, "title": {"label": "Perfect Bank, my apologies"}, "content": {"label": "Been banking with you for over two years. You have wonderful stocks to go through", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-29T13:43:06-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.0"}, "id": {"label": "14608510775"}, "title": {"label": "Slow but other wise good"}, "content": {"label": "Every thing is amazing with the app it\u2019s jus the customer support kinda very slow especially when you kinda need access to your account", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-29T12:30:30-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.245.0"}, "id": {"label": "14608313252"}, "title": {"label": "Product is good. App updates are rushed & frustrating."}, "content": {"label": "I like WS a lot but\u2026 updates that don\u2019t show all holdings on one list without splitting them and requiring more clicks is unnecessary & bad. List view modes require being chosen again after flipping to next page of holdings. 20 holdings shouldn\u2019t require a split. Watchlist access also needs to be more easily visible/accessible.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:vote