actions)", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-26T06:15:39-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14595569395"}, "title": {"label": "Love it"}, "content": {"label": "Best canadian banking experience. would just love to reorder the chequing accounts and get multiple virtual card and an indicator on which card they are in the apple wallet! \ud83d\ude4f", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-25T14:54:44-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14593242212"}, "title": {"label": "Best app to trade commission free in canada."}, "content": {"label": "I have been a user since 2019 and this app hasn\u2019t disappointed me yet. Amazing ui and support. Also, it\u2019s got the best offers and banking accounts that offer amazing rates.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-25T00:01:47-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14590662053"}, "title": {"label": "Stellar"}, "content": {"label": "I never am one to write reviews, but this bank just does everything right. The day corporate greed takes over, which inevitably it will, and they start changing their policies to look like the big banks, I\u2019ll move all my funds to another startup bank that offers what Wealthsimple currently offers. I hope this never happens, but it\u2019s a fact of life. As of now, a very well-deserved 5 stars.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-24T17:06:47-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14589661931"}, "title": {"label": "I\u2019m Very Impressed"}, "content": {"label": "When I moved to Canada, RBC was my first bank. Then I stumbled on Tangerine and I thought it was way better than RBC. About a year later, I found WealthSimple. I\u2019ve been with WS for more than 5 years, and I\u2019ve been very impressed by the pace of innovation. It\u2019s now my main bank and I have multiple products with them, and I\u2019m actively advocating for my family members and friends to move to them. No other bank in Canada comes close to them. Please keep up the excellent work you\u2019re doing WS. I wish it\u2019s publicly traded - would love to be a shareholder!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-24T16:02:29-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14589503203"}, "title": {"label": "Happy with doing all my banking with Wealthsimple, highly recommend"}, "content": {"label": "Happy with doing all my banking with Wealthsimple, highly recommend", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-24T13:27:56-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14589120690"}, "title": {"label": "Unwarranted fees"}, "content": {"label": "New fees randomly. I no longer respect wealthsimple as much as i did two days ago. 1.654 stars", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-24T10:14:49-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14588575220"}, "title": {"label": "Love it!"}, "content": {"label": "This is the easiest way to get started on investing and building a budget with automatic transfers and deposits. It\u2019s so easy to use, flexible and forgiving. I\u2019m blown away!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-23T19:53:11-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14586266905"}, "title": {"label": "Best Banking App"}, "content": {"label": "This app is literally an all-in-one spot for everything related to banking.\n\nYou can trade crypto, open multiple checking account accounts, with customization like changing the names with emojis of these accounts,\n\nThey do giveaways\n\nyou were an interest on your checking account balance", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-23T10:09:33-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14584731150"}, "title": {"label": "Consume too much data"}, "content": {"label": "Even with very light usage it consumes a lot data. I suspect it steals your data!  Dont trust!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-23T09:42:31-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "2.244.0"}, "id": {"label": "14584646067"}, "title": {"label": "Day One!"}, "content": {"label": "My nephew urged me to deposit some money here. He's 18 years old and is very knowledgeable because of the wealth simple app ! So far, things seem straightforward and simple . He is going to give me a tutorial of the app later this evening. Stay tuned.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1403491709&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"updated": {"label": "2026-09-22T17:07:13-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:versi